			"notes": "Breast physics have been reworked. Movements are now more natural and realistic, while the physics still take gameplay conventions into account and do not interfere with gameplay.\n\nSupport for EmoteCraft and Bendable Cuboids has been added. The physics now correctly respond to the character’s body movements during the playback of emotes and animations.\n\nSettings presets have been added. You can now save your preferred settings and quickly apply them later.\n\nA settings reset option has been added. You can now restore the settings to their default values at any time."
		},
